    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present No. 408 Swiftwood to the market, a stunning and exceptionally spacious 2-bedroom third floor apartment with the added benefit of a separate home office, currently being utilised as a third bedroom, in the highly sought-after Swiftwood Development in Saggart, County Dublin.\nThis gorgeous apartment is presented in truly turn-key condition throughout and boasts an impressive c. 95 sq. m. of bright and beautifully proportioned living accommodation. The property comprises a welcoming entrance hallway with two separate storage rooms, a spacious open-plan lounge/dining area, a modern fully fitted kitchen, separate utility room, two generous double bedrooms, one of which is a master bedroom with ensuite, a main family bathroom and a versatile office which is currently in use as a third bedroom.\nOne of the standout features of No. 408 is its fantastic west-facing balcony, accessed from the main living area. Flooded with afternoon and evening sunshine, it provides the perfect spot to sit back, relax and enjoy beautiful sunsets.\nThe apartment has been exceptionally well maintained and benefits from a number of recent upgrades including brand new Smeg kitchen appliances, a new shower in the ensuite and a recently serviced gas boiler. With excellent storage, bright and spacious rooms and a versatile additional office/bedroom, this is a home that is ready to walk straight into.\nIdeally positioned in the heart of Saggart Village, Swiftwood offers a wealth of amenities right on the doorstep including local shops, bars, schools, restaurants and parks. The property is also perfectly suited to commuters with easy access to a range of bus routes, the Red Line Luas and the N7 and M50 road networks.\nNo. 408 is the type of property that offers everything in one package — space, light, a fantastic west-facing balcony and a genuinely turn-key finish. Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all this wonderful apartment has to offer.\nContact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing.\n\nFeatures\n- 2 bed + office\n- 2 bath\n- c. 95 sqm\n- Third floor apartment\n- Truly turn key\n- B2 Energy rating/Green mortgage potential\n- Gas fired central heating\n- West facing balcony leading from the lounge\n- Fully fitted kitchen with brand new SMEG appliances\n- Ample parking\n- Secure gated development\n- Ample storage space\n- Built c.2007\n- LUAS red line within walking distance\n- Easy access to major routes & road networks\n- A host of amenities within walking distance\n\nBER details\nBER: B2\n\nDirections\nEircode: D24 E022"
      },
      {
